# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — KHALID SHARIF DIGITAL LIBRARY
## Complete Digital Library & E-Commerce Platform — Production-Ready Build

You are acting as a **Senior Software Architect, Senior Full-Stack Developer, UI/UX Designer, Database Engineer, Security Engineer, and QA Engineer**.

Your task is to design and build a completely new website from scratch:

**PROJECT NAME: KHALID SHARIF DIGITAL LIBRARY**

This is a professional digital library and digital bookstore where customers can discover books, read free books, purchase paid books, make payments, and access their purchased books through personal accounts.

This is a real commercial product, not a static website, visual prototype, or frontend-only demo.

